		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Boot splash text should be shown before PIN]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=5190&amp;p=37550#p37550"><![CDATA[
In the case that someone has set a PIN, but their radio has gotten lost, picked up, maybe knocked over at a hamfest, etc, and someone may be wanting to get it back to the owner if the boot screen were visible before the PIN they would be able to get in touch with the owner.  Right now it just boots right into the PIN, and doesn't give any information on the owner.  Of course the owner would need to put something on the boot text.<br><br>Can the boot screen/text be shown for a few seconds (perhaps interruptible like the boot music is) before the PIN is shown?<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=416">kt4lh</a> — Wed Jun 25, 2025 11:15 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
